            "sid": "HEB 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba badaydeaba nih geendeawi ng'asheega saang'a jea eerukuna hang'waay rukunooda, earapeadi mwang'ada iidigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Earapeadi aba damani miisa awoosa giinealshoodigean, gamiiseegwa gideaba gajanyasa sih nuut jea ghoanaaleegwa gicha ng'asheega majeekcheewi bea madeeda bea ASEETA. Googasayi eanooga, mii hamita hang'waay gil; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba siida ghus eanooga mwanala gil aba ng'asheega doabiiw, aba gideaba niny baleanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamita hang'waay gaba fuga nihitiisa heeda, nea giika mideawa fughareengean ea siinaal sinooda gichea gooheeleata ng'asheega miyaasiin ea gea munyas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
